                "text": "\ud83d\udccdUvalde\n\nToday marks an important milestone for mental health access in Texas with the groundbreaking of a NEW Regional Behavioral Health Campus in Uvalde. \n\nThis project has been several years in the making, and I\u2019m proud to have delivered $2 million in federal funds to help with construction for this facility, which will service 32 counties in rural Texas. #UvaldeUnited",
