                "text": "I joined my fellow Co-Chairs of the Mental Health Caucus for a roundtable focused on youth mental health.\n\nI appreciated hearing our brave witnesses share their stories. Mental health matters\u2014I\u2019ve secured & advocated for increased mental health funding & research in #TX23 & across the U.S. You can count on me to continue prioritizing this important issue in Congress.",
