                "text": "Preserving funding for colonias is vital for public health, safety, & security from El Paso to Eagle Pass along the border.\n\nMy bill, the Ensuring Continued Access to Funding for Colonias Act, updates outdated policies to ensure colonias can keep working toward self-sufficiency & economic growth.",
