                "text": "Wilford Hall at Lackland Air Force Base is the largest mental health care facility in the Air Force, with 60,000 clinical encounters annually. \n\nThank you to the outstanding professionals for taking care of our active-duty servicemembers\u2014we are grateful for your service. \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 https://t.co/BZiaBpkeoP",
