                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The Agricultural Appropriations bill will receive a vote soon. I\u2019m very pleased to see many of my top priorities in the bill \u2b07\ufe0f\n\n\u2705 $1.2 billion for the Animal & Plant Health Inspection Service (APHIS) to combat pests like the New World screwworm (NWS).\n\n\u2705 $1.8 billion for the Agriculture Research Service to invest in agricultural innovation & protect animals & crops.\n\n\u2705 $110 million for cattle health programs, including screwworm prevention initiatives.\n\nI\u2019m committed to DELIVERING for our farmers and ranchers across #TX23.",
