                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "\ud83d\udea8#ICYMI: Our veterans continue to struggle with high rates of suicide. We can & we must do better. \n\nI partnered with @RepSusieLee on bipartisan legislation to transform the way we deliver mental health services for our nation\u2019s heroes. \n\nRead more about the VA Zero Suicide Demonstration Project Act.\u2b07\ufe0f",
