                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Pleased to see one of my top priorities included in next year\u2019s annual defense package.\n\nThe FY26 NDAA expands mission-specific mental health resources for the Cyber Mission Force, which directly supports 16th Air Force in San Antonio. \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\n\nOur service members train & operate in some of the most intense environments possible. This new provision will help ensure they have proper resources to keep meeting their mark.",
