                "text": "Exciting news for Del Rio! Very soon, there will be a NEW SPORTS COMPLEX in town. \n\nThis is not only a game-changer for our youth in the area, but a positive step forward for community health. \n\nI was pleased to play a part in this by securing over $2M for this project in Congress.\n\nToday, Team Gonzales attended the groundbreaking ceremony \u2014 it\u2019s great to see construction underway.\n\nPhoto Credit: KWMC 1490 AM",
